-<p>The €40,747 annual senior-debt stress is arithmetic from Qredits' published rate and a 60-month annuity, not a lender quote. <!-- CHECK: 05-qredits-terms --> The year-one owner receives the €90,000 replacement-cost compensation hurdle and owns the €30,300 residual. That reaches the income objective on paper. It leaves the €100,000 seller principal unpaid and therefore does not create distributable wealth without restraint.</p>
