+<p>The €40,747 annual senior-debt stress is arithmetic from Qredits' published rate and a 60-month annuity, not a lender quote. <!-- CHECK: 05-qredits-terms --> The €90,000 CEO line is total employer cost. It comprises €72,000 gross salary and €18,000 employer tax, pension and benefit overhead. The owner receives only the salary before personal tax.</p>
